{"steam_appid":1553260,"steam_name":"Scarlet Deer Inn","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1553260/2075117111/7546d043f09488cf240386aeaa2744dcf168971e/1784381233/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784643919","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257379721/c665411547b89bd80ff9aaa9a50fded3695b14d1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784643919","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/a16375e51ba2449b1deae9f56b564625087ef035/ss_a16375e51ba2449b1deae9f56b564625087ef035.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785572441","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/e0b676fcc00d97409bb6b44f456ceb929dc64b03/ss_e0b676fcc00d97409bb6b44f456ceb929dc64b03.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785572441","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/88b67ad3e18d3bd12cc0094177720160d586f9ac/ss_88b67ad3e18d3bd12cc0094177720160d586f9ac.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785572441","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/d24e0d69a76441a5015e529f88fdf6c3677fe3f2/ss_d24e0d69a76441a5015e529f88fdf6c3677fe3f2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785572441","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/8d2e255d50252975f78dee11fe7a0870cf96951c/ss_8d2e255d50252975f78dee11fe7a0870cf96951c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785572441"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Works great on Steam Deck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're still waiting for Valve to officially verify Scarlet Deer Inn, but we designed the game to work well on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/1c42bf85906db4e8f1c85e5430817204.poster.avif?t=1785572441\" width=550 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/1c42bf85906db4e8f1c85e5430817204.webm?t=1785572441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/1c42bf85906db4e8f1c85e5430817204.mp4?t=1785572441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong><u>ABOUT</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scarlet Deer Inn is an embroidered dark medieval folk tale. While life in a seemingly ordinary village is all about simple chores and idle gossip, sinister secrets hide below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/bacd0c4b9d00409eb41d8fcaafba519b.avif?t=1785572441\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-painted backgrounds and traditional animations crafted from physically embroidered frames. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world filled with colourful characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden shortcuts in the dark that make each playthrough easier. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Folk music inspired by the Middle Ages and performed on traditional instruments. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elise is a mother of two. She is not exactly extraordinary, and there are no heroic epics written about her.   <br>Her circumstances will force  her to explore unusual places and face dark, terrifying situations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE TEAM</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attu Games is a husband-and-wife team from the Czech Republic. During the development of Scarlet Deer Inn, their duo expanded into a trio with the birth of their baby, bringing a whole new level of chaos to the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/2536c4497c843fae8e454a196d2d8d5f.avif?t=1785572441\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64-bit) or better<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Intel i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11-compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A 64-bit system is required to run the game.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Attu Games"],"publishers":["Attu Games","Aurakenn Games"],"release_date":"Jul 21, 2026"}